   "description": "Three devices in a daisy chain on a 5 V supply. The controller's data enters DI of LED1; each DO feeds DI of the next device, and DO of LED3 carries the remaining data on to further devices. Every device has its own 100 nF capacitor from its VDD pin to ground, and the GND and VDD-5V rails run through to the far end of the chain.",
